recommend check-in (Claude) the roster row for comlink_r1_dual_stack is the deferred half -- it wants `capability ipv6` plus `tier cadence` (151s including the a1 suite) in construction/standing-equipment.kyri, which grain-65 held staged this lap; either they take it or a later lap does once their file is quiet. Beside it: %328's seat (can the roster's own witness be rostered at all, given the scan refuses on any red the card holds) is now the thing standing between this bench and a green self-witness.
